# Direct requirements for the isolated Blackwell document-model runtime.
# The CUDA wheel is installed from the PyTorch index in create_gpu_runtime.sh.
# Paddle 3.3.0 is installed from the hash-pinned CPU wheel declared in
# gpu-runtime.toml. CPU FP32 avoids incompatible CUDA dependency pins while
# retaining the same PP-OCRv6 model weights and inference graph.
